#: ../../../grids.md:120
msgid "Placing a card in a grid"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../grids.md:122
msgid ""
"The `grid-item-card` directive is a short-hand for placing a card content "
"container inside a grid item (see [Cards](./cards.md)). Most of the `card` "
"directive's options can be used also here:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../grids.md:126
msgid "Title 1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../grids.md:129
